(4416212, 635149, 47541, '<td valign="top">While I doubt this will make the top 10 here (cute kids often dont do well and the idea of a person in a picture frame is used a lot in this challenge) I think this is a fatastic photo.  The isolation of the girl from the background is great and the way the frame is askew is nice.  My only nitpick is the cutting off of her hand at the top - 9</td>', 'While I doubt this will make the top 10 here (cute kids often dont do well and the idea of a person in a picture frame is used a lot in this challenge) I think this is a fatastic photo.  The isolation of the girl from the background is great and the way the frame is askew is nice.  My only nitpick is the cutting off of her hand at the top - 9', '2008-01-23 02:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
