(4420946, 636605, 39679, '<td valign="top">Many people don''t use filters in a way that helps their shots but here, you did a great job of using a gradient filter.  Your point, going from the green of rural to the smoggy industrial urban area is really brought home as a result.  Nice job.</td>', 'Many people don''t use filters in a way that helps their shots but here, you did a great job of using a gradient filter.  Your point, going from the green of rural to the smoggy industrial urban area is really brought home as a result.  Nice job.', '2008-01-24 10:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
