(4421735, 637021, 83407, '<td valign="top">Good picture, you picked a good location with almost perfect symetry, which I love in a shot like this.  I would have given you a 9 or 10, but there''s a few things I don''t like.  If you stpeed back another 5 feet, I think it would have been good, now granted you still got a great shot, and you might have been going into the street or something, but I think it would have turned out better.  I also don''t like the people to the right, you might have been going for that, but I think it would be more special and personal without the people on the right.  Other than that, great picture!!</td>', 'Good picture, you picked a good location with almost perfect symetry, which I love in a shot like this.  I would have given you a 9 or 10, but there''s a few things I don''t like.  If you stpeed back another 5 feet, I think it would have been good, now granted you still got a great shot, and you might have been going into the street or something, but I think it would have turned out better.  I also don''t like the people to the right, you might have been going for that, but I think it would be more special and personal without the people on the right.  Other than that, great picture!!', '2008-01-24 14:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
