(4422240, 634457, 56539, '<td valign="top">I understand what you did, but it does not meet the classical definition of framing.  I assume you are here to learn and improve your photography.  Your creative stretch of the definition of framing will not be able to compete with your competition. Hopefully you will learn what framing is and add to your photographic knowledge.</td>', 'I understand what you did, but it does not meet the classical definition of framing.  I assume you are here to learn and improve your photography.  Your creative stretch of the definition of framing will not be able to compete with your competition. Hopefully you will learn what framing is and add to your photographic knowledge.', '2008-01-24 17:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
