(4424290, 635225, 811, '<td valign="top">I like that the tree is out of focus.  That makes it look like a painting, of sorts, and makes the frame look more focus.  I also like the way the frame is tilted.  I think a tighter crop would make it a stronger photo, though.  Lighting also seems a bit harsh.  A fast shutter speed, if possible, might help.</td>', 'I like that the tree is out of focus.  That makes it look like a painting, of sorts, and makes the frame look more focus.  I also like the way the frame is tilted.  I think a tighter crop would make it a stronger photo, though.  Lighting also seems a bit harsh.  A fast shutter speed, if possible, might help.', '2008-01-25 12:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
