(4426237, 636993, 89005, '<td valign="top">Urrrrg this is nasty. What is it with the eye? Have you shot an undead or just normally dead cat here?<br/> <br/>I think its nasty but that reaction can also give high scores :)<br/> <br/>Don''t hope its you dead-eyed undead cemetery roaming zombie-mummy-wraith-spectre cat?</td>', 'Urrrrg this is nasty. What is it with the eye? Have you shot an undead or just normally dead cat here? I think its nasty but that reaction can also give high scores :) Don''t hope its you dead-eyed undead cemetery roaming zombie-mummy-wraith-spectre cat?', '2008-01-26 11:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
