(4427709, 637121, 48697, '<td valign="top">I like the compostion and the "look through the trees" feel but I find the noise as a distraction. I know the noise may be intentional as to add to the look but I find that it is a bit overbearing in the picture.</td>', 'I like the compostion and the "look through the trees" feel but I find the noise as a distraction. I know the noise may be intentional as to add to the look but I find that it is a bit overbearing in the picture.', '2008-01-26 23:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
