(4427737, 636441, 48697, '<td valign="top">Upon first glance I felt the two bottles in the foreground were too oof and a distraction. But, the longer that I looked at the the photo the more I like the subtlty in this shot. AS you look down towards the in focus bottles you see the red and green tops of the soy bottles and you can start to put together that you are peaking through the same. I do think that it is a bit slanted and could be a bit stronger by straigtening the crop but I like this shot. Well thought out,</td>', 'Upon first glance I felt the two bottles in the foreground were too oof and a distraction. But, the longer that I looked at the the photo the more I like the subtlty in this shot. AS you look down towards the in focus bottles you see the red and green tops of the soy bottles and you can start to put together that you are peaking through the same. I do think that it is a bit slanted and could be a bit stronger by straigtening the crop but I like this shot. Well thought out,', '2008-01-27 00:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
