(4431997, 636634, 41521, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a slight yellow cast to this shot.</td>', 'There seems to be a slight yellow cast to this shot.', '2008-01-28 09:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432127, 637118, 70875, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty awesome idea! The pose, the lighting, the b&amp;w are very well done. I would prefer the water tap turned the other way, or not at all at the frame, and the bench a little bit more clean so it could give a more minimal look at the overall picture. Very freshly picture!</td>', 'This is a pretty awesome idea! The pose, the lighting, the b&w are very well done. I would prefer the water tap turned the other way, or not at all at the frame, and the bench a little bit more clean so it could give a more minimal look at the overall picture. Very freshly picture!', '2008-01-28 09:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432195, 635790, 70875, '<td valign="top">Cool picture with leading lines to the subject. I would prefer for some more sharpess at the first door.</td>', 'Cool picture with leading lines to the subject. I would prefer for some more sharpess at the first door.', '2008-01-28 10:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432215, 635448, 70875, '<td valign="top">I like the b&amp;w prossesing and the curves that lead you in the center .. but the silhouette is not very clear in the center. It gives a perspective on the size of the building though.</td>', 'I like the b&w prossesing and the curves that lead you in the center .. but the silhouette is not very clear in the center. It gives a perspective on the size of the building though.', '2008-01-28 10:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432222, 635489, 70875, '<td valign="top">Pretty calm image!</td>', 'Pretty calm image!', '2008-01-28 10:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432266, 636835, 70875, '<td valign="top">The red blends well with the black &amp; white of the scenery. Nifty spelling title.</td>', 'The red blends well with the black & white of the scenery. Nifty spelling title.', '2008-01-28 10:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432284, 635639, 70875, '<td valign="top">Smart idea and well excecuted. The texture on the hand looks pretty good.</td>', 'Smart idea and well excecuted. The texture on the hand looks pretty good.', '2008-01-28 10:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432325, 636544, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a cute photo.  The centered subject works fine here.  I do think you''ve included too much of the roof IMO.  As for the challenge theme, I''m not sure that you''ve really used foreground or background elements?</td>', 'This is a cute photo.  The centered subject works fine here.  I do think you''ve included too much of the roof IMO.  As for the challenge theme, I''m not sure that you''ve really used foreground or background elements?', '2008-01-28 10:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432331, 635448, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a unique approach to the challenge.  It''s interesting to look at and the leading lines of the walkway work well with the framing.  It would be nice to have a little sky above the person in the distance to make him/her stand out better.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a unique approach to the challenge.  It''s interesting to look at and the leading lines of the walkway work well with the framing.  It would be nice to have a little sky above the person in the distance to make him/her stand out better.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-28 10:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432335, 637021, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great use of a fisheye lens to add impact and to bring in the "frame" even more.  Challenge theme met very well here and you''ve taken care of the technicals too (exposure, DOF, etc...).  Should do well.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great use of a fisheye lens to add impact and to bring in the "frame" even more.  Challenge theme met very well here and you''ve taken care of the technicals too (exposure, DOF, etc...).  Should do well.  Good luck!', '2008-01-28 10:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432377, 636836, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the matching colors (well except for the brown) with the black over white of the dock coordinating with the dogs colors.  Looks like you just missed sharp focus on the dogs face...the dog probably moved out of the focal plane as he/she was moving towards you?  Good job keeping the snow exposed correctly (it''s white - hooray!).  :-)</td>', 'I like the matching colors (well except for the brown) with the black over white of the dock coordinating with the dogs colors.  Looks like you just missed sharp focus on the dogs face...the dog probably moved out of the focal plane as he/she was moving towards you?  Good job keeping the snow exposed correctly (it''s white - hooray!).  :-)', '2008-01-28 10:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432388, 636415, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute portrait, one worth putting on the wall in your home for sure.  :-)  I think this photo could use just a little fill light on the left (bounce flash from a reflector would work) as the shadows on his face are a bit heavy.  As for the challenge theme, from how I''ve read it you''ve not really used a foreground or background element in the framing.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute portrait, one worth putting on the wall in your home for sure.  :-)  I think this photo could use just a little fill light on the left (bounce flash from a reflector would work) as the shadows on his face are a bit heavy.  As for the challenge theme, from how I''ve read it you''ve not really used a foreground or background element in the framing.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-28 10:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432395, 635867, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice view, nice natural frame, and I like the color tones and lighting (you''ve not tried to overprocess it).  You did a good job of giving your composition some thought by off-centering the framed part of this image.  Well done.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice view, nice natural frame, and I like the color tones and lighting (you''ve not tried to overprocess it).  You did a good job of giving your composition some thought by off-centering the framed part of this image.  Well done.  Good luck!', '2008-01-28 10:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432530, 636421, 83328, '<td valign="top">like the idea, but the subjects are a little too small</td>', 'like the idea, but the subjects are a little too small', '2008-01-28 11:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4432537, 634457, 83328, '<td valign="top">this is great, I wish the frame was lighter colored. Really like the minimalist approach though</td>', 'this is great, I wish the frame was lighter colored. Really like the minimalist approach though', '2008-01-28 11:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
