(4432621, 633967, 83328, '<td valign="top">there''s something weird about the symmetry here. It does not seem to be perfectly symmetric, but it might be an optical illusion because there are a ton of lines, don''t know.</td>', 'there''s something weird about the symmetry here. It does not seem to be perfectly symmetric, but it might be an optical illusion because there are a ton of lines, don''t know.', '2008-01-28 11:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
