(4433273, 634457, 30049, '<td valign="top">How convenient is this?!  :-D  Very nice frame for the challenge.  While the boat is "ok" this would really pop if there had been a sailboat or something a bit larger.  I understand that you most likely had zero control over what showed up out there.  :-)  The photo as is, is pleasant to look at, and is fine on merits of technicalities (exposure, focus, etc...).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'How convenient is this?!  :-D  Very nice frame for the challenge.  While the boat is "ok" this would really pop if there had been a sailboat or something a bit larger.  I understand that you most likely had zero control over what showed up out there.  :-)  The photo as is, is pleasant to look at, and is fine on merits of technicalities (exposure, focus, etc...).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-01-28 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4433274, 636869, 33446, '<td valign="top">where does it end and where does it begin?</td>', 'where does it end and where does it begin?', '2008-01-28 14:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
