(4438617, 636852, 67258, '<td valign="top">I had this down as E301 - his inspiration has worked; he is the photographer I most admire on DPC.  I gave this my second highest vote of the challenge.  The composition is superb, the challenge is nailed, and the B&amp;W conversion is excellent with its strong blacks.</td>', 'I had this down as E301 - his inspiration has worked; he is the photographer I most admire on DPC.  I gave this my second highest vote of the challenge.  The composition is superb, the challenge is nailed, and the B&W conversion is excellent with its strong blacks.', '2008-01-30 05:30:59.000000', NULL, 0),
