(4440193, 636754, 35357, '<td valign="top">Don''t sneeze!  You might end up with a great big boulder on your head! ;-)<br/> <br/>I like the balance &amp; attractive colours, congrats!</td>', 'Don''t sneeze!  You might end up with a great big boulder on your head! ;-) I like the balance & attractive colours, congrats!', '2008-01-30 13:44:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4440208, 637070, 66494, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dfstevenson:</b></div><hr/><i> Does not meet the definition of framing.  I hope that you learn from viewing the entries of your competition </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Gee, I hope he learns from your example of creativity. I doubt it tho, not with his attitude. Shhhhhhhheeeeeeeeesh. <br/>Very nice shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by dfstevenson: Does not meet the definition of framing.  I hope that you learn from viewing the entries of your competition   Gee, I hope he learns from your example of creativity. I doubt it tho, not with his attitude. Shhhhhhhheeeeeeeeesh. Very nice shot.', '2008-01-30 13:46:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4440245, 636730, 67697, '<td valign="top">Is this a photo for a wedding album? I thought this was so cool and wow what a fun one to have for that day.  I love the neon color scheme - it gives off a great night on the town feel.  To have her face centered and framed like that is fascinating.</td>', 'Is this a photo for a wedding album? I thought this was so cool and wow what a fun one to have for that day.  I love the neon color scheme - it gives off a great night on the town feel.  To have her face centered and framed like that is fascinating.', '2008-01-30 13:58:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4440276, 637041, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Somebody PLEASE explain this one to me.  I was hoping to get some details after the challenge finished as I am curious.  No location, no cool story...<br/> <br/>What is this place?  Who are the people in the background?  What does the title mean?<br/> <br/>Thanks!  :-D</td>', 'Ok.  Somebody PLEASE explain this one to me.  I was hoping to get some details after the challenge finished as I am curious.  No location, no cool story... What is this place?  Who are the people in the background?  What does the title mean? Thanks!  :-D', '2008-01-30 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4440280, 636730, 67855, '<td valign="top">A great photo, placed to low in my opinion<br/>I gave 9/10 ;)</td>', 'A great photo, placed to low in my opinionI gave 9/10 ;)', '2008-01-30 14:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4440287, 637094, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok, so maybe the exposure could have been brought up a little, but sub 5 score?  I thought this was clever, and so it seems did the commenters overall.  Hmmm.</td>', 'Ok, so maybe the exposure could have been brought up a little, but sub 5 score?  I thought this was clever, and so it seems did the commenters overall.  Hmmm.', '2008-01-30 14:12:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4440297, 635326, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hmmm I''m wondering if those who did not recognize the specs as being snow maybe just have never seen snow before?  I''m not familiar with what framing traditionally means in photography, but in here I do see several things being framed: the several layers of trees and the snow.  I do like that you used natural framing instead of artificial, with the vertical trees running up the sides of the picture.  I think if you had an aurora borealis floating in the white space up there, it would have won the challenge :D</td>', 'Hmmm I''m wondering if those who did not recognize the specs as being snow maybe just have never seen snow before?  I''m not familiar with what framing traditionally means in photography, but in here I do see several things being framed: the several layers of trees and the snow.  I do like that you used natural framing instead of artificial, with the vertical trees running up the sides of the picture.  I think if you had an aurora borealis floating in the white space up there, it would have won the challenge :D', '2008-01-30 14:17:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4440304, 636441, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I must be getting way out of touch with the viewers/voters...I thought this was a very well done image, certainly deserving of a score higher than sub 5.  I gave it an 8 - shows what I know, eh?  :-D</td>', 'Wow.  I must be getting way out of touch with the viewers/voters...I thought this was a very well done image, certainly deserving of a score higher than sub 5.  I gave it an 8 - shows what I know, eh?  :-D', '2008-01-30 14:18:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4440335, 635489, 38127, '<td valign="top">Lovely image Alex... Congratulations on your top ten!!  <br/>the mood and framing are beautiful :)</td>', 'Lovely image Alex... Congratulations on your top ten!!  the mood and framing are beautiful :)', '2008-01-30 14:26:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4440404, 635451, 65319, '<td valign="top">Your model has a lovely, fragile and haunting beauty.  Yet another beautiful portrait!</td>', 'Your model has a lovely, fragile and haunting beauty.  Yet another beautiful portrait!', '2008-01-30 14:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4440492, 636999, 25577, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured the youthfulness in this photo, the editing is excellent work, composition flawless and the lighting is point on.  Great image!</td>', 'I like how you captured the youthfulness in this photo, the editing is excellent work, composition flawless and the lighting is point on.  Great image!', '2008-01-30 14:53:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4440658, 635790, 22390, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the votes and comments.<br/> <br/>:)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-30 15:32:22.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all for the votes and comments. :)', '2008-01-30 15:32:07.000000', '2008-01-30 15:32:22.000000', 0),
(4440665, 634194, 64568, '<td valign="top">Great colours, great composition and focus and superb framing concept- was my only 10 in this challenge- nice one</td>', 'Great colours, great composition and focus and superb framing concept- was my only 10 in this challenge- nice one', '2008-01-30 15:38:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4440669, 635912, 67697, '<td valign="top">The very first thing that caught my eye was the path leading up to the door.  I almost would have liked to have seen a tighter crop maybe cutting off the top to the point where the details start.  This must be a beautiful scene with the trees arching overhead like that.</td>', 'The very first thing that caught my eye was the path leading up to the door.  I almost would have liked to have seen a tighter crop maybe cutting off the top to the point where the details start.  This must be a beautiful scene with the trees arching overhead like that.', '2008-01-30 15:42:03.000000', NULL, 0),
