(4443113, 636727, 73032, '<td valign="top">Well, I thought it was pretty good, considering we all squeezed together in the cold and got this shot and everyone came out perfectly framed. I didn''t have to crop this one bit. The colors we''re a little harsh with the sun behind us, if I remember correctly, so I changed it to black and white. Oh well.</td>', 'Well, I thought it was pretty good, considering we all squeezed together in the cold and got this shot and everyone came out perfectly framed. I didn''t have to crop this one bit. The colors we''re a little harsh with the sun behind us, if I remember correctly, so I changed it to black and white. Oh well.', '2008-01-31 10:41:33.000000', NULL, 0),
