(4446559, 635741, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m glad someone nominated this for an OOBIE.  I thought this was quite clever.  It''s like looking thru a peephole and that is what provided the framing, of course.  I like that it''s not perfectly set up, because that would make it feel clean and posed.  Keep doing your work the way you want to and ignore the nay-sayers.</td>', 'I''m glad someone nominated this for an OOBIE.  I thought this was quite clever.  It''s like looking thru a peephole and that is what provided the framing, of course.  I like that it''s not perfectly set up, because that would make it feel clean and posed.  Keep doing your work the way you want to and ignore the nay-sayers.', '2008-02-01 11:59:13.000000', NULL, 0),
