(4535830, 636730, 27845, '<td valign="top">That''s impressive use of the possibilities a scene offers in order to get all the essential information into an appealing image. Kudos for thinking of this and pulling it off so well.</td>', 'That''s impressive use of the possibilities a scene offers in order to get all the essential information into an appealing image. Kudos for thinking of this and pulling it off so well.', '2008-03-03 15:48:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4554215, 636820, 90394, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful way to capture an otherwise average subject! Colors and technicals are goog, but I would have liked to see the left cripped more. Nice photo! I give a 6.</td>', 'What a beautiful way to capture an otherwise average subject! Colors and technicals are goog, but I would have liked to see the left cripped more. Nice photo! I give a 6.', '2008-03-11 03:40:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4555088, 636820, 74559, '<td valign="top">So yes, a cat''s eyes are incredibly detailed and interesting and definitely worthy of focus, but so is the fur pattern on a cat''s nose!! I love this image, the framing is excellent with so much depth, the cat''s expression is wonderful (like, how dare you enclose me!), and the detail in the focal point of the image, the NOSE, is excellent! IMO, it is perfect as is :-)</td>', 'So yes, a cat''s eyes are incredibly detailed and interesting and definitely worthy of focus, but so is the fur pattern on a cat''s nose!! I love this image, the framing is excellent with so much depth, the cat''s expression is wonderful (like, how dare you enclose me!), and the detail in the focal point of the image, the NOSE, is excellent! IMO, it is perfect as is :-)', '2008-03-11 13:48:58.000000', NULL, 0),
